# Infect is judged against whoever the damage is dealt to (CR 702.90b-c, 120.3): Bot2's Blightsteel Colossus (11/11
# infect) attacks Bot1 unblocked, and its 11 combat damage is dealt to Ancient Adamantoise instead (CR 614.1a), so it
# becomes eleven -1/-1 counters on the Adamantoise, not poison counters on Bot1. The 8/20 Adamantoise is -3/9 and lives.
# Both creatures came onto the battlefield with one Show and Tell.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Ancient Adamantoise
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Blightsteel Colossus
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

