Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ancient Adamantoise)
Bot2.Choose(Blightsteel Colossus)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Attack(Blightsteel Colossus)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

